Engulfs your hands (and weapons) in a sheath of lightning, dealing [11, 14, 17, 20, 22 (TL1-5; SP 100)] lightning damage with a chance to daze (25%) per melee attack and increasing all lightning damage dealt by [7%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

Each hit will also regenerate [0.33, 0.67, 1.00, 1.33, 1.67 (TL1-5)] mana.

The effects will increase with your Spellpower.
